# The devcontainer Dockerfile is an environment image, not a deployable
# Nx project — without this, @nx/docker infers an unnamed project and the
# project-graph build fails with ProjectsWithNoNameError.
.devcontainer

# Nested git worktrees created by Claude Code. Their checkouts contain stale
# .csproj references (e.g. Teck.Cloud.ServiceDefaults) that break the
# project-graph build when Nx descends into them.
.claude/worktrees
